.SS skein memory
.nf
Usage: skein memory [options] [command]

Manage durable local memory

Options:
  -h, --help                  display help for command

Commands:
  search [options] <query>    Search user and workspace memory
  add [options] <content...>  Store a non-secret workspace memory
  forget [options] <id>       Archive a memory
  stats [options]             Show memory storage statistics
  privacy [options]           Review content-free memory retention and local
                              storage privacy
  export [options] [file]     Export reviewed memory as JSON to stdout or an
                              owner-only file
  clear [options]             Permanently delete memory records and candidates
                              in a selected scope
  candidates [options]        List memory proposals awaiting user approval
