.SS skein mcp
.nf
Usage: skein mcp [options] [command]

Inspect configured MCP servers

Options:
  -h, --help                              display help for command

Commands:
  status [options]                        Report redacted MCP trust and connection status without connecting optional servers
  search [options] [query...]             Search configured capability manifests without network access
  inspect [options] <server>              Review a redacted declarative capability manifest without connecting
  trust [options] <server>                Trust the current redacted manifest fingerprint after review
  activate [options] <server> <query...>  Connect one trusted server and load only query-relevant schemas
  disable [options] <server>              Persistently disable an MCP capability and unload its schemas
  revoke [options] <server>               Revoke persisted MCP trust and require a fresh review
  help [command]                          display help for command
.fi
